OL,3,GNEWSAThe 13th Century gift still giving
OL,4,Amillions to charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the last 25 years, charities in
OL,7,FStratford-upon-Avon have seen millions
OL,8,Fof pounds in grants, thanks to a major
OL,9,Fproperty owner in the town giving away
OL,10,Fits profits.
OL,12,FThe concept began, though, in the 13th
OL,13,Fcentury with a donation of property to
OL,14,Fthe town's leaders, with the condition
OL,15,Fthat the money it generated went to the
OL,16,Fpoor.
OL,18,FNow more than 800 years later, the town
OL,19,Fcontinues to get millions of pounds
OL,20,Fevery year through the modern form of
OL,21,Fthe model, Stratford Town Trust, which
OL,22,Fstarted in 2001.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
