OL,3,GNEWSAThe 13th Century gift still giving
OL,4,Amillions to charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatthew Poole, its CEO said: "Over
OL,7,Fthose past 25 years we've managed to
OL,8,Faward almost #45m worth of funding to
OL,9,Fsupport around 3,500 grants."
